  Core.Provenance   — what the instrument structurally cannot tell you.
  Core.Epistemics   — the honesty gates, as machine-readable commitments.
  Stance            — the published claims, each with its status and its kill.

See `epistemology.md` for how truth is determined here and which gates are
mechanically enforced in CI, and `axiomology.md` for how values are determined.
-/
